格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness 桌宠插件：透明置顶的桌面精灵（2D 像素风状态机）","id":"gh:1337326662","install_available":false,"language":"HTML","name":"deepseek-pet-Seeki","slug":"BenjaminSHI4008/deepseek-pet-Seeki","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","desktop-pet","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 桌宠插件：透明置顶的桌面精灵（2D 像素风状态机）"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Seeki"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**A tiny DeepSeek-powered desktop companion that lives on your screen and helps you get things done."},{"id":"p3s2","text":"A tiny DeepSeek-powered desktop companion that lives on your screen and helps you get things done.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"*English · 简体中文*"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Seeki is a pixel pet that floats on your desktop and keeps a DeepSeek Harness agent one double-click"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" away. It's a **Desktop Pet × DeepSeek × Agent** — persistent conversations organized by workspace, "},{"id":"p5s3","text":"per-task model switching, and a character that actually reacts while your agent is working."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> Seeki is an independent community project. It is **not** an official DeepSeek product."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Why Seeki?"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"You can already talk to DeepSeek in a browser tab. Seeki adds the layer a chat UI can't:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Instead of… | Seeki gives you… |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| a tab you have to find | a character that **lives on your desktop**, always one glance away |\n| pa"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"sting context every session | **persistent conversations**, organized into workspaces |\n| one defaul"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"t model | **per-task model switching** — pick a different model for the next message |\n| a static we"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"b app | a **pixel companion** with idle / happy / walking / sleeping states |\n| reading logs | an **"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"at-a-glance status bubble** above the character (received → working → done) |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Every one of these maps to something Seeki actually does today — no marketing filler."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### 🐾 Lives on your desktop"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Seeki is a transparent, frameless, always-on-top window — a 2D pixel character that stays on your sc"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"reen instead of hiding in a tab."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### 💬 Persistent conversations"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Double-click Seeki to chat. Conversations are **persistent and multi-turn**, organized into **worksp"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"aces**, with a conversation switcher to jump back into any previous thread."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### 🧠 A DeepSeek Harness agent behind the pet"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Seeki is the desktop face of a DeepSeek Harness agent. The head bubble reflects the agent's live sta"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"i is the desktop face of a DeepSeek Harness agent. The head bubble reflects the agent's live status:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Status | Bubble |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| `received` | 收到啦 · received |\n| `running` | Deep diving... |\n| `completed` | Completed |\n| `termin"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ated` | Stopped |\n| `offline` | Offline |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### 🔀 Per-task model switching"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Switch between your configured DeepSeek models straight from the chat window. The switch applies to "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"the **next message only** and never interrupts a running turn; a new conversation inherits the curre"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"t message only** and never interrupts a running turn; a new conversation inherits the current model."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### 🎮 A character, not a static icon"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Idle breathing, happy, walking (drag), and sleeping animations — plus drag-direction switching (left"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" / right / up / down with mirroring) and click / idle-timeout interactions."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### ⚙️ Config-driven, no code edits"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Status bubbles, animations, frame rates, and triggers all live in `pet.config.json`, editable throug"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"h a built-in `/pet/settings` page — including **uploading, replacing, and deleting animation frames*"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"a built-in `/pet/settings` page — including **uploading, replacing, and deleting animation frames**."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### 💬 Conversation"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### 🗂️ Workspace & model switching"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### 🎮 Character states"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### Prerequisites"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- **Node.js ≥ 22** and **pnpm**\n- A clone of deepseek-harness with `pnpm install` run once — Seeki r"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"uns as a plugin inside it\n- A **DeepSeek API key** configured for the harness (see Model Configurati"},{"id":"p33s3","text":" as a plugin inside it\n- A **DeepSeek API key** configured for the harness (see Model Configuration)"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"3. **Run** — double-click `Seeki.app` (macOS) / `Seeki.lnk` (Windows). The icon launches DeepSeek Ha"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"rness in the background and wakes Seeki."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"The installer auto-detects your `deepseek-harness` checkout (a sibling directory, `~/deepseek-harnes"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"s`, or `~/Projects/deepseek-harness`) and asks if it can't find it."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Two ways to run, plus a standalone offline mode."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"### A. One-click desktop icon *(recommended)*"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"`scripts/install.sh` (macOS) / `scripts/install.ps1` (Windows) installs the plugin and creates a **p"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"seudo-executable** desktop icon — it contains only a launch command, no bundled runtime."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"- **Start:** double-click → starts the harness in the background → wakes Seeki.\n- **Exit:** right-cl"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"ick the pet → 「退出桌宠」. Quitting Seeki **does not** stop the harness (it keeps running in the backgrou"},{"id":"p42s3","text":"nd; the next double-click just re-wakes the pet)."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"### B. Run with DeepSeek Harness manually"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"### C. Standalone pet (offline, no agent)"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"This runs only the pet. Without a connected harness the bubble shows **Offline**."},{"id":"p48s1","text":"> Electron downloads its binary on `npm install`. On slow networks in mainland China, run\n> `export "},{"id":"p48s2","text":"ELECTRON_MIRROR=\"https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron/\"` first."},{"id":"p49s1","text":"## Model Configuration"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"Seeki doesn't hardcode models. The chat window's model list comes from your DeepSeek Harness's confi"},{"id":"p50s2","text":"gured providers (`llm.models`), so it always reflects what your harness actually advertises (for exa"},{"id":"p50s3","text":"mple **DeepSeek-V4-Pro** and **DeepSeek-V4-Flash** on the `deepseek-official` route)."},{"id":"p51s1","text":"- **API key** — configure it for the harness, not for Seeki: set `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` in the environme"},{"id":"p51s2","text":"nt, in a `.env` file at the harness root, or via the harness's credentials store (`~/.dsh/.credentia"},{"id":"p51s3","text":"ls.yaml`).\n- **Default model** — the harness's own default. Seeki doesn't impose one.\n- **Switch mod"},{"id":"p51s4","text":"els** — use the model dropdown in the chat title bar. It affects the **next message only**; new conv"},{"id":"p51s5","text":"ersations inherit the current selection; unavailable models show as disabled."},{"id":"p52s1","text":"Full `pet.config.json` reference: docs/config.md."},{"id":"p53s1","text":"## How It Works"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"1. The **Electron pet** renders the character and the chat window.\n2. A small **Cordis plugin** (`ds"},{"id":"p55s2","text":"h-pet-status`) runs inside DeepSeek Harness, folding agent activity into statuses and streaming assi"},{"id":"p55s3","text":"stant text over a local WebSocket.\n3. The harness **agent** handles sessions, workspaces, and tools;"},{"id":"p55s4","text":" Seeki is its desktop face."},{"id":"p56s1","text":"Architecture and extension guide: docs/development.md."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
